                                "sense_id": "0fd38be3-3553-392d-a75d-e0eba619348e",
                                "text": "“Please come and see me. . . . Phone book. . . . Under the name of Mrs. Sigourney Howard. . . . My aunt. . . .” [In the novel, \"Mrs. Sigourney Howard\" means \"the wife of Mr. Sigourney Howard\".]"
